*.xcarchive/

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
Packages/*/.build/
Package.resolved.local

## Secrets — never commit these
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Secrets.xcconfig
*.local.xcconfig
AuthKey_*.p8
*.mobileprovision
*.p12

## Supabase local state
supabase/.branches/
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.env
supabase/functions/.env

## Snapshot test failures (the recorded baselines DO get committed)
**/__Snapshots__/**/*.failure.png
**/FailureDiffs/

# Supabase local stack. `config.toml` and migrations ARE tracked; these are not.
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp

# Demo launcher's build output. The launcher keeps its own DerivedData so a demo
# build never fights the one Xcode is using.
.demo-build/

# Generated for pasting into the Supabase SQL editor when a direct Postgres
# connection is not available (IPv6-only db host, blocked 5432). Not committed:
# it is a copy of supabase/migrations/, and a committed copy is one that drifts.
# Regenerate by concatenating that directory.
supabase/all-migrations.sql

## Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
